<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McLeodUSA started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McLeodUSA started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said it initiated coverage of McLeodUSA Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- McLeod gained 1/2 to 31-1/4.</p>
